  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163054137-8bdde290-e939-4f6a-a788-4842866cb1bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">允許戰利品表透過數據包將戰利品整合至其他戰利品表中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">該數據包還允許您控制最終戰利品表生成的物品數量，例如將戰利品箱子中的物品總數限制為 12 個。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/someaddons/871d58d3350296151c3b17395d002dbe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">點擊此處查看使用指南</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">僅需安裝於伺服器端</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cupboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">較新版本需要安裝 <strong>Cupboard</strong> 依賴項</a></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>首次開啟容器時，在聊天欄顯示該容器的戰利品表</li>\n<li>新增戰利品時，給予模組物品更高的掉落機率</li>\n<li>跳過已存在於戰利品表中的物品，避免重複新增</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">結構模組的附加模組，提供更好戰利品並提升模組相容性：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-loot-addon-for-loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Randomized Loot Compatibility</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-adventure-dungeons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Adventures and Dungeons</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-awesome-dungeon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Awesome Dungeons</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-better-archeology\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Archeology</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-bygone-nether-it-takes-a-pillage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bygone Nether &amp; It Takes a Pillage</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-choicetheorems-overhauled\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChoiceTheorem's Overhauled Village &amp; Immersive Structures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-dungeon-crawl\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeon Crawl</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-enhanced-lootintegration-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons Enhanced</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-dungeons-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons Plus</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-dungeons-and-taverns\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons and Taverns</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-dungeonz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeon Z</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-formations-overworld-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Formations Overworld &amp; Nether</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-hopo-better-mineshaft-ruins\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hopo Better Mineshaft, Ruins &amp; Portals</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-ice-and-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-integrated-dungeons-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Dungeons, Villages &amp; Strongholds</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender 's Cataclysm</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-medieval-buildings-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medieval Buildings &amp; End</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-mo-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mo' Structures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-moogs-voyager-soaring-end-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog's Voyager, Soaring, End &amp; Nether Structures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-philips-ruins\" rel=\"nofollow\">Philip's Ruins</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-piglet-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Piglet Structures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-stellarity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stellarity</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-structory-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structory &amp; Towers</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-the-graveyard\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Graveyard</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-the-lost-castle\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Lost Castle</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-towns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-valhelsia-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Valhelsia Structures</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-when-dungeons-arise\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations-yggdrasils\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yggdrasils</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yung-structures-addon-for-loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yung's Structures</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162635503-85e3e64b-3263-4498-944e-ba9741a3c88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p>如果您喜歡這個模組，歡迎考慮支持開發工作，您的任何支持都將備受感激。</p>\n<p>本模組的開發屬於業餘興趣，因此您的支持能讓我投入更多時間進行維護與更新。<br>您可以在 Patreon 上支持我：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/someaddons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162637017-9a30d47b-493d-4743-9029-ac09dcc438f9.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"29\"></a></p>",
